WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:06.109
<v Maya>Can I make Pip do a whole show by itself?

2
00:00:06.566 --> 00:00:12.496
<v Ms. Nova>Yes, with code! Blocks snap together like puzzle pieces, and Pip runs them from top to bottom.

3
00:00:12.958 --> 00:00:17.075
<v Ms. Nova>This program makes Pip wave. Press Go, and watch which block lights up.

4
00:00:17.537 --> 00:00:19.414
<v Maya>The block lights up while it runs!

5
00:00:20.999 --> 00:00:24.348
<v Ms. Nova>Now pick Surprise show from Start from, and press Go again.

6
00:00:25.686 --> 00:00:28.907
<v Maya>Pip talks and plays sounds! Is it different every time?

7
00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:35.706
<v Ms. Nova>Yes! The Surprise blocks pick random numbers. Press Show me the code to see the same program written in Python.

8
00:00:36.177 --> 00:00:38.267
<v Maya>Whoa, real code! I'm a programmer.
